```

```
usage: slurm_account-users.py [-h] [--summary] [--pi] [--pi-compact] [--tree] [--accounts] [--users] [--validate]

Analyze Slurm account hierarchy, users, PIs and project accounts.

options:
  -h, --help    show this help message and exit
  --summary     Show overall account/user summary.
  --pi          Show detailed PI-centric summary.
  --pi-compact  Show compact PI summary.
  --tree        Show account hierarchy including users.
  --accounts    List accounts grouped by type.
  --users       List users by account.
  --validate    Validate account hierarchy.
```
